OL,3,GNEWSAScottish police to target online
OL,4,Agangs forcing children to self-harm
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives in Scotland have joined
OL,7,Finternational law enforcement in
OL,8,Ftargeting online gangs which groom and
OL,9,Fcoerce children into acts of self-harm.
OL,11,FOfficers are hunting members of loose
OL,12,Fonline networks of sadists known as
OL,13,F"The Com", which mainly targets girls
OL,14,Fon gaming platforms and social media.
OL,16,FThe groups, mostly comprised of teenage
OL,17,Fand young adult males, have risen in
OL,18,Fprominence in recent years after cases
OL,19,Finvolving sextortion and hacking, as
OL,20,Fwell as self-harm encouragement.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
